{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban the publication of a criminal\u2019s religion, nationality or immigration status",
        "additional_details": " We feel reporting should focus on an offender's actions and the facts, not characteristics shared by innocent people.\r\n\r\nWe call on the Government to ban public authorities, politicians and media outlets from publishing and highlighting a suspect or criminal\u2019s religion, nationality, ethnicity, or immigration status unless it is directly relevant to the crime or public safety. Unnecessary disclosure could encourage collective blame, inflame tensions, and expose innocent people to hostility or violence. We believe public communication should focus on the individual and promote accountability without fuelling division in society.",
        "background": "We believe publishing a criminal\u2019s religion, nationality, or immigration status unfairly associates entire communities with the actions of one individual, and can fuel prejudice, division, and violence.",
